# several patterns on each side, not identical
-- old.cue --
m: {[=~"^a"]: int, [=~"^b"]: string}
-- new.cue --
m: {[=~"^a"]: int, [=~"^b"]: number}
-- out --
unknown
m has several pattern constraints, [=~"^a"], [=~"^b"] in the prior schema and [=~"^a"], [=~"^b"] in the new one, which the checker compares only for identity (rule unknown-patterns) @ new.cue:1:1
